<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>cpu.pb.gz</title>
<style>
:root{ --bg:#f7f6f9;--panel:#ffffff;--ink:#1d1a17;--muted:#6b6259;--line:#e2dad0;--accent:#b4522a;--warn-bg:#fff6e8;--warn-line:#e8c88a;--ai:#5b4bdb;--ai-bg:#f5f3ff;--ai-line:#d6d1fa;--ok:#1f7a45;--ok-bg:#f1faf4;--ok-line:#bfe3cd;--bad:#b3352a;--bad-bg:#fdf3f2;--bad-line:#f0c8c3;--chip-bg:#ffffff}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){ --bg:#16151a;--panel:#1e1d23;--ink:#eceaf2;--muted:#a29caf;--line:#332f3b;--accent:#ff9a6a;--warn-bg:#2b2313;--warn-line:#6d5722;--fatal-bg:#2e1616;--fatal-line:#7a3232;--ai:#b3a8ff;--ai-bg:#24203d;--ai-line:#433b78;--ok:#7fd8a4;--ok-bg:#142a1d;--ok-line:#2c5a3d;--bad:#ff9a8c;--bad-bg:#2e1616;--bad-line:#7a3232;--chip-bg:#26242c}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{ --bg:#16151a;--panel:#1e1d23;--ink:#eceaf2;--muted:#a29caf;--line:#332f3b;--accent:#ff9a6a;--warn-bg:#2b2313;--warn-line:#6d5722;--fatal-bg:#2e1616;--fatal-line:#7a3232;--ai:#b3a8ff;--ai-bg:#24203d;--ai-line:#433b78;--ok:#7fd8a4;--ok-bg:#142a1d;--ok-line:#2c5a3d;--bad:#ff9a8c;--bad-bg:#2e1616;--bad-line:#7a3232;--chip-bg:#26242c}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:13px/1.5 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
code,.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px}
.muted{color:var(--muted)}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit}
.top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 16px;background:var(--panel);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex-wrap:wrap}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:9px}
.brand b{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.015em}
.brand i{font-style:italic;color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px}
h1{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);margin:0;flex:1;min-width:8em;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.readout{padding:3px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:var(--bg);font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap}
.prov{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg);white-space:nowrap;font-weight:500}
.pill.ok{color:var(--ok);border-color:var(--ok-line);background:var(--ok-bg)}
.pill.bad{color:var(--bad);border-color:var(--bad-line);background:var(--bad-bg)}
.pill.ai{color:var(--ai);border-color:var(--ai-line);background:var(--ai-bg)}
.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:5px 14px;padding:7px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.legend .c{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;white-space:nowrap}
.legend .sw{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(0 0 0/.22);display:inline-block}
.legend .key{margin-left:auto;color:var(--ai)}
.notes{margin:12px 16px 0;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--warn-bg);border:1px solid var(--warn-line);border-radius:8px;font-size:12.5px}
.notes ul{margin:4px 0 0;padding-left:18px}
.body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 420px;align-items:start}
@media (max-width:1000px){.body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
.graph{padding:12px 16px;min-width:0}
.canvas{max-height:72vh;overflow:auto;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:2px}
.chart{position:relative;min-width:100%}
.frame{position:absolute;height:19px;padding:0;border:0;margin:0;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px}
.frame .fl{display:block;padding:0 5px;font:11px/19px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.frame .star{color:#4a39c9;font-weight:700;margin-right:3px}
.frame.cite{outline:2px dashed var(--ai);outline-offset:-2px;z-index:1}
.frame:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:-2px;z-index:2}
.axis{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.left-out{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
h4{margin:16px 0 6px;font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
.exrow{display:flex;width:100%;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:6px 9px;margin:0 0 6px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:var(--panel);cursor:pointer;text-align:left}
.exrow:hover,.exrow:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ai)}
.exrow .star{color:var(--ai);font-weight:700}
.exrow code{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.exrow .w{color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.ref{font:11px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:var(--ai)}
.qgrid,.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto auto 1fr;gap:3px 12px;font-size:12.5px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;align-items:baseline}
.facts{grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr) minmax(9em,1fr)}
.facts .v{white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.k{color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.v{font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.p{color:var(--muted);min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.st{font-size:11px;padding:0 6px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);justify-self:start}
.st-ok{color:var(--ok);border-color:var(--ok-line)}
.st-unavailable{color:var(--bad);border-color:var(--bad-line)}
.qgrid{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px}
.side{background:var(--panel);border-left:1px solid var(--line);min-width:0;position:sticky;top:0;max-height:100vh;overflow:auto}
@media (max-width:1000px){.side{position:static;max-height:none;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}}
.hd{padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.hd .lbl{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.hd .nm{font:600 13.5px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.hd .nid{font:11px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:var(--muted)}
.sec{padding:11px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.sec h5{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600}
.sec h5 .tag{font-weight:500}
.interp h5{color:var(--ai)}
.sec p{margin:0 0 6px}
.claim{font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ok-line);cursor:help}
mark.unchecked{background:var(--warn-bg);color:inherit;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--warn-line);padding:0 1px;cursor:help}
button.cite{display:inline;font:11px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;background:var(--ai-bg);color:var(--ai);border:1px solid var(--ai-line);border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:1px}
.hyp{margin:0;padding-left:18px}
.hyp li{margin:0 0 4px}
.hyp b{color:var(--ai)}
.rej{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.rej li{background:var(--bad-bg);border:1px solid var(--bad-line);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12.5px}
.rej s{color:var(--bad)}
.rej .why{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.path{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.path button{display:flex;width:100%;gap:6px;align-items:baseline;padding:2px 4px;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:left}
.path button:hover,.path button:focus-visible{background:var(--ai-bg)}
.path .pn{font:12px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.path .c{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}
.path li:last-child button{background:var(--ai-bg)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}
.chip{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 11px;font-size:12px;background:var(--chip-bg);cursor:pointer}
.chip:hover,.chip:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ai);color:var(--ai)}
#copybox{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:8px;font:12px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:6px}
#copybox[hidden]{display:none}
.foot{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 18px;padding:8px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:18px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s;pointer-events:none;max-width:90vw}
.toast.on{opacity:1}
</style>
<style>
:root{
  --fill-dl:0%;
  --fill-ds:1;
  --fill-j:0;
  --hatch-ink:rgb(22 20 18 / .26);

  --hatch-gap: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,var(--hatch-ink) 0 2.2px,transparent 2.2px 6px);
  --hatch-inf: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,var(--hatch-ink) 0 1.4px,transparent 1.4px 5px);
  --hatch-bare: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,var(--hatch-ink) 0 3.2px,transparent 3.2px 5px);
  --hatch-obf: radial-gradient(var(--hatch-ink) .9px,transparent 1px) 0 0/5px 5px;
  --hatch-interp: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,var(--hatch-ink) 0 2.2px,transparent 2.2px 6px);

  --fill-app:      hsl(335 calc(78% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(79% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-system:   hsl(  2 calc(68% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(78% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-vendor:   hsl( 50 calc(88% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(69% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-kernel:   hsl( 28 calc(92% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(70% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-boundary: hsl(  0                        0%  calc(84% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-boundary-unattributed: hsl(0             0%  calc(92% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-gpu-kernel: hsl(128 calc(48% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(67% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-accel-source: hsl(184 calc(52% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(65% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-unsym: hsl( 45 calc(20% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(77% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-shim:  hsl(215 calc(15% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(77% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --fill-root: hsl(30 calc(8% * var(--fill-ds)) calc(81% + var(--fill-dl)));

  --edge-frame:        rgb(255 255 255 / .55);
  --edge-boundary:     hsl(  0  0% calc(40% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --edge-unattributed: hsl(  0  0% calc(55% + var(--fill-dl)));
  --edge-shim:         hsl(215 24% calc(46% + var(--fill-dl)));

  --frame-ink: hsl(30 12% 9%);
  --fill-match: hsl(300 100% 71%);
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--fill-dl:-9%;--fill-ds:.9;--hatch-ink:rgb(22 20 18 / .20)}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--fill-dl:-9%;--fill-ds:.9;--hatch-ink:rgb(22 20 18 / .20)}

.frame{color:var(--frame-ink);background-color:var(--fill-x);background-color:hsl(from var(--fill-x) h s calc(l + var(--fill-j)));box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 .5px var(--edge-frame)}
[data-domain="root"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-root)}
[data-domain="app"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-app)}
[data-domain="system"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-system)}
[data-domain="kernel"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-kernel)}
[data-domain="vendor"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-vendor)}
[data-domain="unsym"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-unsym)}
[data-resolution="module-offset"]{background-image:var(--hatch-gap)}
[data-resolution="bare-address"]{background-image:var(--hatch-bare)}
[data-resolution="obfuscated"]{background-image:var(--hatch-obf)}
[data-resolution="interpreter"]{background-image:var(--hatch-interp)}
[data-domain="gpu-kernel"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-gpu-kernel)}
[data-domain="shim"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-shim);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--edge-shim)}
[data-domain="boundary"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-boundary);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--edge-boundary)}
[data-domain="boundary-unattributed"]{--fill-x:var(--fill-boundary-unattributed);background-image:var(--hatch-gap);box-shadow:none;outline:1px dashed var(--edge-unattributed);outline-offset:-1px}
.frame.inexact{background-image:var(--hatch-inf)}
.frame.inexact[data-domain="boundary-unattributed"]{background-image:var(--hatch-gap),var(--hatch-inf)}
.frame.inexact[data-resolution="module-offset"]{background-image:var(--hatch-gap),var(--hatch-inf)}
.frame.inexact[data-resolution="bare-address"]{background-image:var(--hatch-bare),var(--hatch-inf)}
.frame.inexact[data-resolution="obfuscated"]{background-image:var(--hatch-obf),var(--hatch-inf)}
.frame.inexact[data-resolution="interpreter"]{background-image:var(--hatch-interp),var(--hatch-inf)}

.frame:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.4px var(--frame-ink);outline:none}
.frame.match{background-color:var(--fill-match)}
.frame.cur{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1.8px var(--frame-ink);outline:none}
.sw[data-domain]{background-color:var(--fill-x)}
.sw.res-module-offset{background-image:var(--hatch-gap)}
.sw.res-bare-address{background-image:var(--hatch-bare)}
.sw.res-obfuscated{background-image:var(--hatch-obf)}
.sw.res-interpreter{background-image:var(--hatch-interp)}
.j1{--fill-j:1.14}
.j2{--fill-j:2.29}
.j3{--fill-j:3.43}
.j4{--fill-j:4.57}
.j5{--fill-j:5.71}
.j6{--fill-j:6.86}
.j7{--fill-j:8.00}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
<span class="brand"><b>perf-agent</b><i>Enjoy the Flames.</i></span>
<h1>cpu.pb.gz</h1>
<span class="readout">View <b>cpu/nanoseconds#0</b></span>
<div class="prov">
<span class="pill ai">✦ Explained by an agent via MCP</span>
<span class="pill ok" title="Each structured claim was compared with the engine at its rounding, and each frame reference resolved">1 figure or reference checked</span>
<span class="pill">prose is not verified</span>
<span class="pill bad">1 claim rejected</span>
</div>
</header>
<div class="legend" aria-label="Colour key"><span class="c"><i class="sw" data-domain="app"></i>application</span><span class="c key">✦ path with an explanation</span></div>
<main class="body">
<div class="graph">
<div class="canvas"><div class="chart" id="chart" style="height:80px">
<div class="frame" style="left:0%;width:100%;top:0px" data-i="0" data-domain="root" tabindex="0" role="button" title="1.00 µs, 100.0% of total"><span class="fl">all</span></div>
<div class="frame" style="left:0%;width:100%;top:20px" data-i="1" data-domain="app" tabindex="0" role="button" title="1.00 µs, 100.0% of total"><span class="fl">main</span></div>
<div class="frame" style="left:0%;width:51.1%;top:40px" data-i="2" data-domain="app" tabindex="0" role="button" title="511 ns, 51.1% of total"><span class="fl">a</span></div>
<div class="frame j3" style="left:51.1%;width:48.9%;top:40px" data-i="3" data-domain="app" tabindex="0" role="button" title="489 ns, 48.9% of total"><span class="fl">c</span></div>
<div class="frame cur" style="left:0%;width:41.1%;top:60px" data-i="4" data-domain="app" tabindex="0" role="button" title="411 ns, 41.1% of total"><span class="fl"><span class="star">✦</span>b</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="axis"><span>cpu/nanoseconds#0 · width = cpu (nanoseconds) at or below the frame</span><span title="1000 nanoseconds, exact">total 1.00 µs</span></div>
<section aria-label="Paths the agent explained"><h4>Paths the agent explained</h4>
<button type="button" class="exrow" data-node="19f8d19ed72f72ff"><span class="star">✦</span><span class="ref">f4</span><code>b</code><span class="w">41.1% · 411 ns</span></button>
</section>
<section aria-label="Quality summary"><h4>Quality summary</h4>
<div class="qgrid"><span class="k">Unresolved frames</span><span class="v" title="0.000 ratio of view_total, rounded to 0.001 ratio, measured zero">0</span><span class="st st-zero">zero</span><span class="p">share of the view with an unresolved frame</span><span class="k">Executions log</span><span class="v" title="unavailable: no sidecar">unavailable: no sidecar</span><span class="st st-unavailable">unavailable</span><span class="p">executions are not counted</span></div>
</section>
</div>
<aside class="side" aria-label="Selected frame">
<div class="hd"><div class="lbl">Frame details · <span class="ref" id="sel-ref">f4</span></div><div class="nm" id="sel-name">b</div><div class="nid" id="sel-id">19f8d19ed72f72ff</div></div>
<section class="sec"><h5>Profile facts — computed by perf-agent</h5>
<div class="facts" id="facts"><span class="k">Cumulative</span><span class="v" title="411 nanoseconds, exact">411 ns</span><span class="p"></span><span class="k">Self</span><span class="v" title="411 nanoseconds, exact">411 ns</span><span class="p"></span><span class="k">Share of total</span><span class="v" title="0.411 ratio of view_total, rounded to 0.001 ratio">41.1%</span><span class="p">of the view total</span><span class="k">Share of parent</span><span class="v" title="0.804 ratio of parent:50666367c7698688, rounded to 0.001 ratio">80.4%</span><span class="p">of a</span><span class="k">Inexact portion</span><span class="v" title="0 nanoseconds, exact, measured zero">0</span><span class="p">from inexact samples</span><span class="k">Executions below</span><span class="v" title="unavailable: no sidecar">unavailable: no sidecar</span><span class="p">the executions log is not usable</span><span class="k">Kernel names observed</span><span class="v" title="unavailable: not a GPU view">unavailable: not a GPU view</span><span class="p">names at or below, not distinct kernels</span></div>
</section>
<div id="exp"><section class="sec interp"><h5>Agent interpretation — prose, not verified</h5><p>b takes <span class="claim" title="share_of_total of b (node 19f8d19ed72f72ff): 0.411 ratio of view_total, rounded to 0.001 ratio; checked by perf-agent">41.1%</span></p></section>
</div>
<p class="sec muted" id="noexp" hidden>The agent did not explain this frame: these are the profile's facts only.</p>
<section class="sec"><h5>Rejected attempts on this profile and view</h5>
<p class="muted">perf-agent refused these attempts on this profile and view, before or after this publication (attempt a1). A claim row strikes through the agent's figure beside the engine's; reference and limit rows say what was wrong.</p>
<ul class="rej"><li><span class="ref">a2</span> claim c1 (<code>share_of_total</code> of c (node dc7211ebcac6e9c7)): the agent wrote <s>0.62</s>, perf-agent has <b>48.9%</b><div class="why">value_mismatch: share_of_total is 0.489 at the engine&#39;s rounding (0.001 ratio); 0.62 is 0.620 at that rounding</div></li>
</ul>
</section>
<section class="sec"><h5>Path (root → frame)</h5>
<ol class="path" id="path"><li><button type="button" data-node="6d8817fb4e98e681"><span class="ref">f1</span><span class="pn">main</span><span class="c">100.0%</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-node="50666367c7698688"><span class="ref">f2</span><span class="pn">a</span><span class="c">51.1%</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-node="19f8d19ed72f72ff"><span class="ref">f4</span><span class="pn">b</span><span class="c">41.1%</span></button></li></ol>
</section>
<section class="sec"><h5>Follow up in your agent</h5>
<p class="muted">Copies a question to paste into your MCP client, with the profile and the frame already named.</p>
<div class="chips" id="chips"><button type="button" class="chip" data-prompt="Why is node 19f8d19ed72f72ff (b) wide? Use perf-agent-mcp: open the profile cpu.pb.gz (relative to the profiles root), check that its profile_digest is 891132b92a6ac5299fbf52b1cb95fc7f8a4f8c07d04354077e4471c128e9b17b, view cpu/nanoseconds#0.">Why is it wide?</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-prompt="Is any of node 19f8d19ed72f72ff profiler overhead? Use perf-agent-mcp: open the profile cpu.pb.gz (relative to the profiles root), check that its profile_digest is 891132b92a6ac5299fbf52b1cb95fc7f8a4f8c07d04354077e4471c128e9b17b, view cpu/nanoseconds#0.">Is it profiler overhead?</button><button type="button" class="chip" data-prompt="Compare node 19f8d19ed72f72ff with another profile using diff. Use perf-agent-mcp: open the profile cpu.pb.gz (relative to the profiles root), check that its profile_digest is 891132b92a6ac5299fbf52b1cb95fc7f8a4f8c07d04354077e4471c128e9b17b, view cpu/nanoseconds#0.">Compare with another profile</button></div>
<textarea id="copybox" rows="3" readonly hidden aria-label="Prompt to copy"></textarea>
</section>
</aside>
